   "en": "You don't own customers on a marketplace. You rent them. 🛍️\n\n1️⃣ Commission and fees on every single sale\n✅ Fix: your own store on your own domain\n\n2️⃣ You never get the customer's name or number\n✅ Fix: your own customer list for restock and repeat orders\n\n3️⃣ Slow pages and long checkouts lose carts\n✅ Fix: a fast store with a short UPI checkout\n\nKesar & Clay is a concept demo.\nSend this to a D2C brand owner who needs it.\nWant this for your brand? Comment STORE 👇\n\nVoiceover is AI-generated."
